{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16993","headline":"题故蔡国公主九华观上池院 · 武元衡","name":"题故蔡国公主九华观上池院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱门临九衢，云木蔼仙居。\n曲沼天波接，层台凤舞余。\n曙烟深碧筱，香露湿红蕖。\n瑶瑟含风韵，纱窗积翠虚。\n秦楼今寂寞，真界竟何如。\n不与蓬瀛异，迢迢远玉除。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}